---
// Newsletter Section: Premium Editorial "The Weekly Signal" Preview (Honest & Non-Deceptive)
---

<section class="bg-white py-14 sm:py-20 border-b border-[#E3E8EF]" aria-labelledby="newsletter-heading">
  <div class="container-main">

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl rounded-2xl border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-[#F7F9FC] p-8 sm:p-12 text-center shadow-xs">

      <!-- Eyebrow Badge -->
      <div class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-[#3478F6] uppercase shadow-2xs">
        <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#3478F6]"></span>
        <span>The Weekly Signal</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Heading -->
      <h2 id="newsletter-heading" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#14233B]">
        Stay Curious. Understand Deeper.
      </h2>

      <!-- Description -->
      <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-[#4B5565]">
        We are preparing a weekly curated newsletter delivering the most interesting technology breakthroughs, scientific discoveries, and practical tutorials directly to your inbox.
      </p>

      <!-- 3 Editorial Principles Grid -->
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 text-left">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white p-4 shadow-2xs">
          <span class="text-xs font-black text-[#3478F6]">01</span>
          <h3 class="mt-1 text-xs font-bold text-[#14233B] uppercase tracking-wider">Zero Clickbait</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#697586] leading-relaxed">Honest insights and clear explanations without exaggerated hype.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white p-4 shadow-2xs">
          <span class="text-xs font-black text-[#3478F6]">02</span>
          <h3 class="mt-1 text-xs font-bold text-[#14233B] uppercase tracking-wider">Helpful Sourcing</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#697586] leading-relaxed">Direct links to official docs, code repositories, and original studies.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white p-4 shadow-2xs">
          <span class="text-xs font-black text-[#3478F6]">03</span>
          <h3 class="mt-1 text-xs font-bold text-[#14233B] uppercase tracking-wider">Privacy First</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#697586] leading-relaxed">No spam, no selling your email. Unsubscribe at any time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Transparent Notice & Working Alternative -->
      <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-[#E3E8EF] flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-[#697586]">
        <p class="text-left">
          <strong class="font-bold text-[#14233B]">Status:</strong> Direct email subscription will launch once our dedicated mail relay is activated.
        </p>

        <a
          href="/rss.xml"
          class="shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[#3478F6] px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white shadow-2xs transition-colors hover:bg-[#2563EB]"
        >
          <span>Subscribe via RSS 2.0</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
